    "text": {
      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice-template\" style=\"text-align:justify;background:#fff7f7;margin-left:2%;padding:0 1em;border:1px solid #b77;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p>The title of this article is <i><b>conjectural</b></i>; an official name for the article's subject has not been found, so it has been given a fitting title by editors. If there is an official name, it is requested that the article <b>Powerup</b> be <a href=\"/wiki/Special:MovePage/Powerup\" title=\"Special:MovePage/Powerup\">moved</a> to the correct name.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Powerups</b> are one-time use consumable items that provide benefits to potion making. They can be received by completing quests issued by <a href=\"/wiki/Travelers\" title=\"Travelers\">travelers</a>, and are received in bundles. Each traveler has their own powerup type they award after a quest is completed. Powerups also have a chance to be received when a traveler fulfills a request, and the typed received depends on the request type, while the chance for obtaining it depends on the level of the traveler. Powerups are automatically used, and cannot manually be stored. Powerups can be used in conjunction with one another.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Types_of_powerups\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Types of powerups</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Enhancement_failure_protection\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enhancement failure protection</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Enhancement_bonus\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enhancement bonus</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Sell_bonus\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sell bonus</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Types_of_powerups\">Types of powerups</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPowerup%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enhancement_failure_protection\">Enhancement failure protection</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPowerup%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb  \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 59px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/c/c2/EnhancementFailureProtection.png/revision/latest?cb=20150605233317\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"EnhancementFailureProtection\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/c/c2/EnhancementFailureProtection.png/revision/latest?cb=20150605233317\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"59\" height=\"71\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"EnhancementFailureProtection.png\" data-image-key=\"EnhancementFailureProtection.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The enhancement failure protection powerup will protect a potion from being destroyed if an enhancement fails. One enhancement failure protection is consumed automatically when an enhancement fails. The travelers that give this powerup are <a href=\"/wiki/Neet\" title=\"Neet\">Neet</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Claire\" title=\"Claire\">Claire</a>. Certain requests also grant this powerup.</p><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enhancement_bonus\">Enhancement bonus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPowerup%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 107px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/01/EnhancementBonus.png/revision/latest?cb=20150605233555\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"EnhancementBonus\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/01/EnhancementBonus.png/revision/latest?cb=20150605233555\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"107\" height=\"73\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"EnhancementBonus.png\" data-image-key=\"EnhancementBonus.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:EnhancementBonus.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The enhancement bonus powerup adds <span style=\"font-family: Courier;\">10%</span> to the enhancement success rate. The enhancement bonus becomes more useful then the enhancement failure protection powerup when a potion's success rate falls under <span style=\"font-family: Courier;\">10%</span>. However, it can also be used alongside the Enhancement failure protection powerup, effectively multiplying the success rate by <span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\" style=\"display: none;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"{\\displaystyle 2(x+0.1)}\">\n  <semantics>\n    <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n      <mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n        <mn>2</mn>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n        <mi>x</mi>\n        <mo>+</mo>\n        <mn>0.1</mn>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n      </mstyle>\n    </mrow>\n    <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle 2(x+0.1)}</annotation>\n  </semantics>\n</math></span><img src=\"https://services.fandom.com/mathoid-facade/v1/media/math/render/svg/12bd82c0296cb6f13c4b650e7b8db92de71d3cc9\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex; max-width:10.114ex; max-height:2.843ex;\" alt=\"{\\displaystyle 2(x+0.1)}\" /></span>, where x is the potion's current percent chance, assuming there are enough powerups for all enhancements. Only <a href=\"/wiki/Dolbur\" title=\"Dolbur\">Dolbur</a> gives this powerup as a reward. Certain requests also grant this powerup.</p><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sell_bonus\">Sell bonus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPowerup%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb  \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 72px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/e/e5/SellBonus.png/revision/latest?cb=20150605233316\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SellBonus\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/e/e5/SellBonus.png/revision/latest?cb=20150605233316\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"72\" height=\"70\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"SellBonus.png\" data-image-key=\"SellBonus.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The sell bonus powerup doubles the amount of coins gained when selling a <a href=\"/wiki/Potion\" title=\"Potion\">potion</a>. The travelers who give this powerup are <a href=\"/wiki/Tirami\" title=\"Tirami\">Tirami</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Piria\" title=\"Piria\">Piria</a>. Certain requests also grant this powerup.</p><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#CC0033\" colspan=\"2\">Items\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#FFC; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Material\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Material\">Material</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Potion\" title=\"Potion\">Potion</a> • <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Powerup</strong> • <a href=\"/wiki/Costume\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Costume\">Costume</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fairy\" title=\"Fairy\">Fairy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Pushcat\" title=\"Pushcat\">Pushcat</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\">Blackcat</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table id=\"Stub\" class=\"noprint stub plainlinks\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><i>This article is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Stub\">stub</a>. You can help Potion Maker Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Powerup?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">expanding it</a>.</i>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261013065605\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 116/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1571/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 36/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.973      1 -total\n 43.15%    4.